text:
Graciasssss 😊❤❤❤ 
@SOFT AIR SERENADE.
Es una suave danza del aire pleno de aromas de jazmines rosas y nardos.

@sureshjohnekm Thank you so much for your incredibly kind words! ❤🎻✨ 

I'm truly grateful that the music could inspire you and bring you such a special feeling. Your encouragement means more than you know and inspires me to keep creating beautiful music. 

May your days be filled with peace, joy, and wonderful moments. God bless you too! ❤🌿🎶

@Lucerna_HarmoniaThank you, you are very kind. Mozart's music has been the majority of my listening for decades. The color subtleties and diversity seen in his music cannot yet be fully recreated by AI, as it is limited by the mathematical patterns that are actually recognizable.
However, I think that the music that you create with the help of AI is of better quality than most of the music creations that "for meditation, for relaxation etc..." are offered by many channels. I find their creations shallow, yours are imaginative and refreshing.
I wonder how long it will be before the AI ​​reaches a level where they are on par with the works of W.A. Mozart himself. Then I may become a more regular listener to your work. Good luck with your creations!
